  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "Artwork by @hok0dok0 representing a stylized Scenecore character design, featuring a rainbow checkerboard background and neon striped accessories. Scenecore fashion represents a 2020s evolution of the original Scene style, heavily influenced by contemporary internet trends such as 2020 Alt, E-Girl, and Animecore. The wardrobe prioritizes a maximalist approach to layering, commonly featuring distressed skinny jeans or leggings worn under tutus and pleated skirts. Tops frequently consist of graphic t-shirts layered over long-sleeve striped shirts, alongside hoodies featuring animal ears or all-over prints. Footwear typically includes platform boots, colorful high-top sneakers, and decorated…"
